WEBVTT

00:00:02.550 --> 00:00:03.920
Now, then...

00:00:03.350 --> 00:00:07.900
<b>Episode 23: Lucifer and the Biscuit Hammer</b>

00:00:04.780 --> 00:00:07.440
Whoever wants to stop the Princess, 
please come at me.

00:00:08.430 --> 00:00:09.990
I'll take you on.

00:00:12.680 --> 00:00:13.480
Neu!

00:00:13.480 --> 00:00:14.820
Say something, damn it!

00:00:17.230 --> 00:00:18.740
Subaru-chan, Yuki-chan,

00:00:18.740 --> 00:00:21.040
please take care of 
Shinonome-san and Akane-kun.

00:00:21.040 --> 00:00:22.750
Where are you going, Sorano-san?

00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:24.290
Over there.

00:00:24.290 --> 00:00:26.960
You two shouldn't fight against Amamiya-san!

00:00:27.590 --> 00:00:30.880
Shit, I can't even stand!

00:00:30.880 --> 00:00:32.920
This looks like so much fun, too, damn it!

00:00:32.920 --> 00:00:34.040
Huh?

00:00:34.670 --> 00:00:40.100
Why am I not the one 
standing over there right now?

00:00:40.630 --> 00:00:41.620
Yuuhi.

00:00:41.620 --> 00:00:43.630
I'm glad Mikazuki isn't here.

00:00:44.110 --> 00:00:45.640
If I fought him,

00:00:45.640 --> 00:00:49.370
I'm sure I'd have too much fun 
and burn through all my power.

00:00:49.880 --> 00:00:53.690
But you're still facing 
two Mythic Beast Knights...

00:00:54.470 --> 00:00:56.160
I'll manage.

00:00:56.160 --> 00:00:58.810
Babylon is a power meant 
for fighting other people anyways.

00:01:00.460 --> 00:01:03.430
This power, my effort, my planning...

00:01:03.430 --> 00:01:06.300
All of it was for this day today!

00:01:08.210 --> 00:01:11.390
I can't believe we had such 
a secret boss ahead of us.

00:01:11.390 --> 00:01:12.930
What will you do, Nagumo?

00:01:12.930 --> 00:01:15.010
I'll stop them both without killing them.

00:01:15.010 --> 00:01:16.630
I'll break their will.

00:01:17.060 --> 00:01:20.220
We are the protectors of this planet.

00:01:20.220 --> 00:01:22.870
This day is finally here.

00:01:22.870 --> 00:01:24.690
It is, Sia.

00:01:24.690 --> 00:01:26.010
Will you be okay?

00:01:26.010 --> 00:01:29.520
Those two are really strong, Yako.

00:01:29.520 --> 00:01:30.580
I'm fine.

00:01:30.580 --> 00:01:31.940
But I will stop them.

00:01:32.870 --> 00:01:36.030
I'll be the one to capture Amamiya-kun!

00:01:45.990 --> 00:01:48.620
Your weakness is 
that you're both too strong.

00:01:50.260 --> 00:01:52.310
S-So heavy.

00:01:53.150 --> 00:01:55.400
You didn't imagine you would be 
fighting another person,

00:01:55.400 --> 00:01:58.030
so your concentration is divided 
by holding back your power.

00:01:58.500 --> 00:02:01.460
You won't be able to beat me 
while you still see our abilities

00:02:01.460 --> 00:02:02.890
as just offensive power.

00:02:04.070 --> 00:02:08.310
Hakudou, did you know 
about Asahina and Amamiya?

00:02:08.310 --> 00:02:09.270
Yes.

00:02:10.230 --> 00:02:14.020
I overheard them talking 
during our summer camp.

00:02:15.750 --> 00:02:17.820
And you believed them?

00:02:17.820 --> 00:02:19.530
I wouldn't have.

00:02:19.930 --> 00:02:23.990
There's no way those two seriously 
long to destroy the world.

00:02:25.110 --> 00:02:27.140
Not our Amamiya Yuuhi.

00:02:27.140 --> 00:02:29.280
Not our Asahina Samidare.

00:02:30.130 --> 00:02:32.210
That's not very like you, Nagumo-san.

00:02:32.210 --> 00:02:34.420
Voicing your doubts on the battlefield.

00:02:35.150 --> 00:02:36.750
They're not doubts.

00:02:36.750 --> 00:02:38.130
They're disappointments.

00:02:39.840 --> 00:02:43.490
If anyone breaks a bone 
before all is said and done,

00:02:43.490 --> 00:02:45.180
then we won't be able to go drinking later.

00:02:46.700 --> 00:02:49.020
Drinking, you say?

00:02:49.750 --> 00:02:52.720
Amamiya, when we get back, 
we're having an after party!

00:02:52.720 --> 00:02:55.060
You two can't shatter the Earth,

00:02:55.060 --> 00:02:56.980
so realize that before you get hurt!

00:03:02.910 --> 00:03:06.120
Then please just watch without interfering.

00:03:06.570 --> 00:03:09.770
It's an adult's job to admonish children,

00:03:09.770 --> 00:03:11.540
and I want to stop you two!

00:03:12.120 --> 00:03:13.840
I want to do my job.

00:03:13.840 --> 00:03:15.090
I am unemployed, after all.

00:03:15.710 --> 00:03:17.240
Thank you very much.

00:03:17.730 --> 00:03:19.670
Please try and stop us...

00:03:19.670 --> 00:03:21.090
if you even can!

00:03:24.270 --> 00:03:25.100
There!

00:03:40.610 --> 00:03:41.820
I can't capture him!

00:03:41.820 --> 00:03:42.850
Why not?!

00:03:42.850 --> 00:03:44.820
It was so easy during our training!

00:03:44.820 --> 00:03:47.030
That was also groundwork I laid for today.

00:03:48.240 --> 00:03:49.580
<i>Water?</i>

00:03:51.160 --> 00:03:52.640
He dodged it?!

00:03:53.540 --> 00:03:54.500
I can't get control!

00:03:54.780 --> 00:03:59.460
<i>Amamiya's Babylon improves his speed 
while lowering the speed of his opponents.</i>

00:04:00.920 --> 00:04:02.880
<i>It's so hard to deal with!</i>

00:04:02.880 --> 00:04:04.450
<i>The water's so heavy...</i>

00:04:04.450 --> 00:04:05.590
<i>My control is...</i>

00:04:05.590 --> 00:04:08.340
<i>I'll capture him, whatever it takes!</i>

00:04:17.840 --> 00:04:18.710
Now!

00:04:18.710 --> 00:04:21.440
Freeze it and stop... him...

00:04:27.600 --> 00:04:29.490
I'm sorry.

00:04:30.180 --> 00:04:31.810
Out of stamina?

00:04:31.810 --> 00:04:35.370
No, you're not a Mythic Beast Knight, 
so you fought well.

00:04:39.260 --> 00:04:42.300
Damn it, damn it, damn it!

00:04:42.380 --> 00:04:45.110
Damn it, damn it, damn it!

00:04:45.110 --> 00:04:47.890
I want to be there!

00:04:48.200 --> 00:04:49.280
Wake up!

00:04:49.280 --> 00:04:51.220
Please, heal us!

00:04:54.240 --> 00:04:55.830
Aloha...

00:04:57.510 --> 00:04:59.060
<i>What's he dreaming of?</i>

00:05:00.380 --> 00:05:02.230
H-Hey!

00:05:02.230 --> 00:05:03.070
Wha?!

00:05:11.310 --> 00:05:14.540
Y-Yuu-kun, that's awful.

00:05:16.510 --> 00:05:18.590
Give it up already, Nagumo.

00:05:18.590 --> 00:05:20.540
None of you can beat Amamiya.

00:05:20.930 --> 00:05:22.000
Anima!

00:05:25.070 --> 00:05:27.020
Maximum output!

00:05:29.350 --> 00:05:31.210
Dragon King Club!

00:05:32.930 --> 00:05:34.640
Hakudou! You're going too far!

00:05:42.640 --> 00:05:44.620
What recklessness!

00:05:44.620 --> 00:05:46.790
I used the last of my stamina 
to defend against that.

00:05:52.340 --> 00:05:53.980
I'm sorry, Hakudou-san.

00:05:56.330 --> 00:05:57.220
But I...

00:06:04.920 --> 00:06:08.190
I love that girl.

00:06:08.810 --> 00:06:13.180
So I want to be the one 
to stop her—not anybody else.

00:06:22.330 --> 00:06:23.600
Yeah.

00:06:23.600 --> 00:06:27.360
I knew you would say that, Yuu-kun.

00:06:46.170 --> 00:06:51.480
<i>When I looked up, 
that sky was full of wonders.</i>

00:06:51.480 --> 00:06:56.780
<i>The despair I bottled up tormented me,</i>

00:06:56.780 --> 00:07:00.640
<i>and I wanted the courage 
to break my chains of isolation.</i>

00:07:00.640 --> 00:07:02.010
<i>(You are my light)</i>

00:07:02.020 --> 00:07:07.610
<i>I was searching for your 
brilliant light in my hazy dreams</i>

00:07:07.610 --> 00:07:11.910
<i>to kick away the limits placed on myself.</i>

00:07:11.910 --> 00:07:16.870
<i>Now with your courage, 
let's soar into the sky.</i>

00:07:16.870 --> 00:07:19.500
<i>Let's CRUSH the fear!</i>

00:07:19.500 --> 00:07:24.580
<i>I swear to you, at the ends 
of this chaotic world,</i>

00:07:24.580 --> 00:07:27.330
<i>that even if you fall, I'll</i>

00:07:27.330 --> 00:07:29.690
<i>Be the HERO!</i>

00:07:29.690 --> 00:07:34.870
<i>I'll be waiting at the future 
we're moving toward,</i>

00:07:34.870 --> 00:07:38.820
<i>with a “YES, MY LORD!” 
for your constant radiance,</i>

00:07:38.820 --> 00:07:42.830
<i>clutching the stars raining down upon us.</i>

00:07:42.830 --> 00:07:50.570
<i>I'll love you until we reach 
that future you want to destroy.</i>

00:08:06.430 --> 00:08:08.840
I ain't gonna let that thing destroy Earth!

00:08:08.840 --> 00:08:10.300
Because!

00:08:10.300 --> 00:08:15.300
My fist'll be the one to smash this planet!

00:08:16.680 --> 00:08:18.350
Amamiya Yuuhi.

00:08:19.000 --> 00:08:21.180
Swear your fealty to me.

00:08:21.970 --> 00:08:25.000
The two of us met one year ago.

00:08:26.440 --> 00:08:28.940
You'll stop Asahina all by yourself?

00:08:28.940 --> 00:08:29.870
Yes.

00:08:29.870 --> 00:08:31.800
So everyone else, please stay out of it.

00:08:33.470 --> 00:08:34.240
Princess.

00:08:38.080 --> 00:08:40.560
<i>I knew, Yuu-kun.</i>

00:08:40.560 --> 00:08:41.880
<i>I knew it would end this way.</i>

00:08:42.600 --> 00:08:47.710
<i>Because you've always been my hero, Yuu-kun.</i>

00:08:57.270 --> 00:08:58.440
Hyou-kun.

00:08:59.350 --> 00:09:00.430
Well,

00:09:02.850 --> 00:09:03.920
try and stop me?

00:09:05.240 --> 00:09:06.560
I'll stop you!

00:09:07.290 --> 00:09:09.980
<i>See? You're so cool.</i>

00:09:10.960 --> 00:09:11.990
Here I come.

00:09:32.590 --> 00:09:34.480
<i>Yuu-kun, do you remember?</i>

00:09:35.020 --> 00:09:37.340
<i>At my birthday last year.</i>

00:09:41.440 --> 00:09:43.340
Happy Birthday!

00:09:41.890 --> 00:09:43.340
<i>I had fun.</i>

00:09:43.910 --> 00:09:48.010
If you want, you could grow 
into an adult, too.

00:09:48.010 --> 00:09:50.020
<i>Thanks, Neu.</i>

00:09:50.740 --> 00:09:52.980
<i>That was the first time 
I mentioned it, wasn't it?</i>

00:09:53.580 --> 00:09:58.350
<i>That I'm sick, and I don't have long 
to live without Anima.</i>

00:09:59.450 --> 00:10:00.460
<i>Sorry.</i>

00:10:00.910 --> 00:10:03.280
<i>We had so much fun on that day, too.</i>

00:10:06.480 --> 00:10:08.580
<i>Thanks, Yuu-kun...</i>

00:10:08.580 --> 00:10:10.040
Die with me?

00:10:10.420 --> 00:10:11.890
Gladly.

00:10:11.890 --> 00:10:14.410
<i>...for saying that to me back then.</i>

00:10:15.910 --> 00:10:19.530
<i>I was so happy and so sad, 
I didn't know what to do.</i>

00:10:21.220 --> 00:10:24.970
I'll face all ten alone 
and defeat every last one.

00:10:25.230 --> 00:10:29.520
<i>The things you said, your face, your eyes...</i>

00:10:31.560 --> 00:10:35.280
<i>They always sent my heart racing.</i>

00:10:35.280 --> 00:10:37.330
Why is Samidare-san...

00:10:37.330 --> 00:10:39.860
...fighting with that look on her face?

00:10:40.640 --> 00:10:42.070
<i>I think it was when you cried</i>

00:10:42.070 --> 00:10:46.030
<i>after realizing you had inherited 
Shinonome-san's techniques.</i>

00:10:46.920 --> 00:10:49.600
<i>That was when I first thought it 
might turn out like this one day.</i>

00:10:50.960 --> 00:10:55.150
Yuu-kun, no matter what choices you 
make after coming to love this world,

00:10:55.150 --> 00:10:56.920
I'll still love you along with it.

00:10:57.820 --> 00:11:01.680
Even if you try and stop me 
in the final battle.

00:11:02.410 --> 00:11:05.230
I belong to you.

00:11:05.930 --> 00:11:10.350
I would gladly offer you 
this planet that I love.

00:11:10.350 --> 00:11:11.700
<i>Liar.</i>

00:11:13.000 --> 00:11:16.650
<i>That was around the time 
we met everyone else.</i>

00:11:17.310 --> 00:11:18.900
<i>Thanks, everyone...</i>

00:11:19.860 --> 00:11:22.040
<i>for being my friend.</i>

00:11:24.590 --> 00:11:26.090
<i>When my mother came to visit...</i>

00:11:26.900 --> 00:11:28.190
<i>That was when I knew.</i>

00:11:30.230 --> 00:11:32.460
I can't become an adult.

00:11:34.790 --> 00:11:38.530
<i>I knew for sure that you would stop me.</i>

00:11:38.530 --> 00:11:40.480
You don't need to be scared.

00:11:40.480 --> 00:11:41.720
You have me.

00:11:41.720 --> 00:11:44.400
<i>But... you were so cool.</i>

00:11:45.870 --> 00:11:48.890
<i>My love for the world 
grew stronger and stronger.</i>

00:11:49.630 --> 00:11:51.980
<i>I didn't want the final battle to come.</i>

00:11:52.380 --> 00:11:54.490
<i>I wanted those days to last forever.</i>

00:11:55.030 --> 00:11:56.830
<i>That's how I wanted to feel.</i>

00:11:57.640 --> 00:12:02.330
<i>But I was soon forced to realize 
that it was impossible.</i>

00:12:03.010 --> 00:12:08.330
A long time ago, my friend lost her 
little brother in a traffic accident.

00:12:08.330 --> 00:12:09.160
Huh?

00:12:09.700 --> 00:12:14.550
Back then, she often said, 
"I wish I had died with him."

00:12:15.210 --> 00:12:19.660
But you know, that friend 
is currently married and happy.

00:12:21.630 --> 00:12:24.180
People are able to find happiness.

00:12:25.020 --> 00:12:26.880
It's okay for people to be happy.

00:12:28.740 --> 00:12:31.060
<i>Time kept passing, even 
though I wanted it to stop.</i>

00:12:31.950 --> 00:12:34.920
<i>Yuu-kun kept growing cooler, and cooler,</i>

00:12:35.680 --> 00:12:37.900
<i>and cooler, and ever cooler.</i>

00:12:41.860 --> 00:12:44.820
I can't believe even Amamiya 
is stuck on the defensive.

00:12:44.820 --> 00:12:47.280
Are you okay, Yuuhi?

00:12:47.280 --> 00:12:48.280
Yeah.

00:12:48.840 --> 00:12:51.070
<i>See? There's that look again.</i>

00:12:51.950 --> 00:12:54.620
<i>As the final battle drew closer, 
I thought to myself...</i>

00:12:55.280 --> 00:12:59.500
What do you think of "Wish Granting Light" 
as the name for our combination field?

00:12:59.500 --> 00:13:01.050
I think it's nice.

00:13:01.050 --> 00:13:02.640
Yeah.

00:13:02.640 --> 00:13:05.280
If that's what you two decided on, 
then that's the best name.

00:13:06.510 --> 00:13:08.060
It's a nice name.

00:13:08.060 --> 00:13:09.640
What do you think, Yuu-kun?

00:13:09.640 --> 00:13:11.110
I'm all for it.

00:13:12.220 --> 00:13:17.130
It is the technique 
that will grant all our wishes.

00:13:17.930 --> 00:13:18.940
<i>"Ahh..."</i>

00:13:20.240 --> 00:13:22.670
<i>"Everyone wants to have a future,"</i>

00:13:22.670 --> 00:13:25.530
<i>"but I can't be there with them."</i>

00:13:26.960 --> 00:13:30.960
<i>"They're all going to find happiness 
in a future without me."</i>

00:13:32.680 --> 00:13:35.680
<i>"Time, stop! Please stop!"</i>

00:13:37.410 --> 00:13:38.710
<i>I knew.</i>

00:13:39.500 --> 00:13:41.960
<i>And yet, still, I...</i>

00:13:46.180 --> 00:13:47.000
<i>Huh?</i>

00:13:53.140 --> 00:13:54.850
<i>I need more power!</i>

00:13:58.350 --> 00:13:59.190
Yuu-kun?!

00:13:59.190 --> 00:14:00.650
Amamiya-san!

00:14:00.040 --> 00:14:00.650
Neu!

00:14:00.650 --> 00:14:01.860
Amamiya-kun!

00:14:01.860 --> 00:14:03.070
Amamiya-san!

00:14:03.070 --> 00:14:04.170
Amamiya-kun!

00:14:04.170 --> 00:14:05.030
Neu!

00:14:05.030 --> 00:14:06.050
Amamiya!

00:14:06.050 --> 00:14:06.990
Neu!

00:14:08.160 --> 00:14:09.110
Yuu-kun.

00:14:13.620 --> 00:14:16.560
Superpowers are random and haphazard.

00:14:16.560 --> 00:14:18.370
As long as you long for it 
with conviction...

00:14:18.370 --> 00:14:19.900
Amamiya! Are you okay?!

00:14:19.900 --> 00:14:20.630
Yes!

00:14:21.440 --> 00:14:23.280
Then destiny will respond.

00:14:23.910 --> 00:14:26.630
I-Invincible!

00:14:27.650 --> 00:14:30.010
That's the man I fell in love with.

00:14:31.220 --> 00:14:33.500
<i>You're amazing, Yuu-kun.</i>

00:14:33.500 --> 00:14:38.020
<i>You keep coming to stop me 
when I can no longer stop myself.</i>

00:14:39.670 --> 00:14:41.270
<i>You're my hero!</i>

00:14:44.820 --> 00:14:45.930
Huh?

00:14:45.930 --> 00:14:48.410
The halberd I was holding is gone?

00:14:48.410 --> 00:14:51.200
And I can feel power welling up inside me.

00:14:52.350 --> 00:14:54.280
Yuuhi, did you shrink?

00:14:55.370 --> 00:14:58.250
No, did I get bigger?

00:14:58.750 --> 00:15:00.540
Invincible?!

00:15:00.770 --> 00:15:02.750
H-How?

00:15:03.720 --> 00:15:04.730
Yuu-kun...

00:15:09.500 --> 00:15:11.750
Here I come, Black Dragon Knight.

00:15:15.740 --> 00:15:18.490
Go, and learn who he is.

00:15:27.690 --> 00:15:29.280
<i>All right, I parried her!</i>

00:15:34.480 --> 00:15:38.370
I should tell you all... about her.

00:15:38.930 --> 00:15:39.850
Anima?

00:15:40.760 --> 00:15:47.170
Her body is afflicted with an illness 
that still has no treatment in this age.

00:15:48.270 --> 00:15:53.100
In the past, her illness gave her 
neither pain nor pleasure.

00:15:54.330 --> 00:15:59.310
What mattered to her was whether 
or not she felt alive in the moment.

00:15:59.870 --> 00:16:01.810
She was an enlightened child.

00:16:02.390 --> 00:16:03.550
Huh?

00:16:04.010 --> 00:16:05.360
An illness?

00:16:05.360 --> 00:16:06.910
Sami-chan was?

00:16:06.910 --> 00:16:08.980
This is the first I've heard of that.

00:16:08.980 --> 00:16:11.830
When she met the young Amamiya Yuuhi

00:16:11.830 --> 00:16:14.830
and I showed her what 
Earth looks like from space,

00:16:14.830 --> 00:16:18.080
Samidare finally gained desires 
of her own for the first time.

00:16:18.940 --> 00:16:22.910
She longed to be reunited with 
Amamiya Yuuhi and to own the Earth.

00:16:23.290 --> 00:16:25.180
Own the Earth?

00:16:25.180 --> 00:16:27.000
What kind of idea is that?

00:16:27.380 --> 00:16:30.060
Shattering the Earth with her own hands.

00:16:30.060 --> 00:16:33.150
That was the only means of owning it 
that she could come up with.

00:16:33.870 --> 00:16:38.470
She probably would have longed 
to own the Earth regardless of her illness.

00:16:38.990 --> 00:16:42.100
And her illness wouldn't matter 
if she shattered the Earth,

00:16:42.100 --> 00:16:43.940
since everything would end with that.

00:16:44.560 --> 00:16:48.900
So in her eyes her illness didn't matter.

00:16:49.720 --> 00:16:52.390
However, she was then reunited 
with Amamiya Yuuhi,

00:16:52.390 --> 00:16:54.360
and she met all of you.

00:16:54.700 --> 00:16:57.240
She learned what happiness was.

00:16:57.800 --> 00:17:01.330
While she once thought life 
was just loving and wanting the world,

00:17:01.870 --> 00:17:05.790
she learned that the world would also

00:17:06.480 --> 00:17:08.290
love her back.

00:17:09.100 --> 00:17:11.260
She started missing every day that passed,

00:17:11.910 --> 00:17:15.160
and the number of times she 
recalled her illness grew.

00:17:15.710 --> 00:17:18.720
Whether she crushed the Earth or not,

00:17:18.720 --> 00:17:20.430
these days would come to an end.

00:17:20.890 --> 00:17:23.680
There's nothing for her going forward, 
and nothing for her if she stops.

00:17:24.290 --> 00:17:26.880
So she can't stop herself anymore.

00:17:27.480 --> 00:17:29.700
That's why it has to be Amamiya Yuuhi.

00:17:31.300 --> 00:17:33.650
What are you just rambling on for?

00:17:34.050 --> 00:17:37.610
What happens to Yuu-kun 
after he stops the princess?

00:17:37.610 --> 00:17:41.300
What happens to the Princess 
after Yuu-kun stops her?

00:17:41.300 --> 00:17:43.830
Is there nothing I can do?!

00:17:44.210 --> 00:17:49.680
I told Sami-chan that people can be happy 
even after losing someone they loved.

00:17:49.680 --> 00:17:52.470
I wanted to her to know people are strong,

00:17:52.470 --> 00:17:56.170
but Sami-chan probably 
thought I was forsaking her.

00:17:56.550 --> 00:17:58.400
I want to do something, too!

00:17:58.400 --> 00:18:00.510
Is there nothing we can do, Anima?!

00:18:00.510 --> 00:18:04.970
I don't want Sami-chan to think 
she's all alone, either, Anima!

00:18:04.970 --> 00:18:05.930
Anima!

00:18:05.930 --> 00:18:07.140
Anima...

00:18:07.140 --> 00:18:08.350
Anima!

00:18:08.650 --> 00:18:09.810
Anima...

00:18:10.850 --> 00:18:12.280
You want to do something?

00:18:12.280 --> 00:18:13.980
Can you do something?

00:18:13.980 --> 00:18:16.030
Decide that for yourselves.

00:18:28.110 --> 00:18:29.590
Beast Knights...

00:18:30.950 --> 00:18:32.190
Thank you...

00:18:33.200 --> 00:18:35.190
for meeting that girl.

00:18:40.600 --> 00:18:44.810
Sorry, Yuu-kun, I've become too strong.

00:18:45.220 --> 00:18:47.380
Her strength is on a whole different level!

00:18:48.060 --> 00:18:49.020
Babylon!

00:18:51.150 --> 00:18:53.230
Sorry, I can blow that away, too.

00:18:54.140 --> 00:18:57.240
Thank you, for trying to stop me.

00:18:58.320 --> 00:19:01.600
I see... Guess it was
impossible, even for you.

00:19:04.840 --> 00:19:06.800
Well, I'll be going now.

00:19:08.170 --> 00:19:09.500
G-Going where?!

00:19:09.500 --> 00:19:11.740
To the Ultra Samidare Punch.

00:19:12.750 --> 00:19:14.090
I'll go end it all.

00:19:14.090 --> 00:19:16.420
Princess! Hey, Yuuhi!

00:19:17.570 --> 00:19:18.500
Bye-bye.

00:19:29.540 --> 00:19:31.060
You told me, didn't you?!

00:19:31.610 --> 00:19:33.560
That's enough, Yuu-kun.

00:19:34.930 --> 00:19:36.500
That I can soar...

00:19:36.500 --> 00:19:37.530
Enough already.

00:19:43.450 --> 00:19:45.370
...higher than you!

00:20:24.030 --> 00:20:26.730
<i>I don't know what we can do to save her.</i>

00:20:26.730 --> 00:20:27.990
<i>So, Amamiya...</i>

00:20:27.990 --> 00:20:29.830
<i>We're entrusting her to you!</i>

00:20:29.830 --> 00:20:32.210
<i>And let us bear that burden with you!</i>

00:20:32.620 --> 00:20:36.670
<i>I'm sorry I didn't understand 
your pain before!</i>

00:20:36.670 --> 00:20:40.630
<i>So tell us more about Sami-chan!</i>

00:20:40.990 --> 00:20:43.220
<i>Because we all want to be together...</i>

00:20:43.580 --> 00:20:45.800
<i>For even a minute or a second longer.</i>

00:20:46.980 --> 00:20:49.350
Space-Time Ebb...

00:20:49.890 --> 00:20:51.420
Damn it!

00:20:51.420 --> 00:20:53.350
Go!

00:21:10.740 --> 00:21:12.510
You can't stop time!

00:21:12.510 --> 00:21:14.300
I won't change my decision!

00:21:14.300 --> 00:21:15.960
So everything ends today!

00:21:15.960 --> 00:21:17.690
I love you!

00:21:17.690 --> 00:21:19.310
I want to shoulder your burdens!

00:21:19.310 --> 00:21:20.820
My mind has never wavered!

00:21:20.820 --> 00:21:21.840
Not since that day!

00:21:21.840 --> 00:21:23.050
I'm ending it!

00:21:23.350 --> 00:21:24.500
I'm...!

00:21:37.050 --> 00:21:38.490
I'm here with you!

00:21:55.490 --> 00:21:57.660
I'll go with you instead of the Earth!

00:21:58.380 --> 00:22:00.540
I'll sacrifice my life for you!

00:22:01.080 --> 00:22:04.510
So live with me,

00:22:06.120 --> 00:22:07.460
and let's die together!

00:22:10.240 --> 00:22:11.400
No, it's okay.

00:22:11.400 --> 00:22:13.020
You don't have to go that far.

00:22:21.820 --> 00:22:23.140
Yuu-kun.

00:22:23.140 --> 00:22:26.660
I love you, Yuu-kun.

00:22:27.960 --> 00:22:31.530
I love you more than this planet.

00:22:38.000 --> 00:22:41.820
<i>I'll become a hero from nothing.</i>

00:22:51.910 --> 00:22:54.430
<i>Hey, you know, I wish</i>

00:22:54.430 --> 00:22:57.750
<i>I was the only person in the world.</i>

00:22:57.750 --> 00:23:02.630
<i>I didn't want to learn I was all alone.</i>

00:23:02.630 --> 00:23:04.980
<i>Ahh, I'm so empty</i>

00:23:04.980 --> 00:23:08.350
<i>and I just wanted to shine, 
but I'm so weak.</i>

00:23:08.350 --> 00:23:13.120
<i>I was waiting for the courage 
to stop my trembling.</i>

00:23:13.120 --> 00:23:15.870
<i>I looked up at the sky I couldn't fly in</i>

00:23:15.870 --> 00:23:18.110
<i>To avoid getting hurt.</i>

00:23:18.110 --> 00:23:23.050
<i>But now it's goodbye to that old me.</i>

00:23:23.050 --> 00:23:28.310
<i>We smiled, we cried, and 
I learned another side of you.</i>

00:23:28.310 --> 00:23:31.760
<i>The pain you hide, what hides 
behind your smile, this world,</i>

00:23:31.760 --> 00:23:33.640
<i>I'll destroy it all,</i>

00:23:33.640 --> 00:23:39.010
<i>So I'll run, and I'll fall, 
and I'll still rise up again,</i>

00:23:39.010 --> 00:23:43.380
<i>Because tonight I'm coming to save you.</i>

00:23:44.250 --> 00:23:48.120
<i>I'll become a hero from nothing.</i>

00:23:49.610 --> 00:23:55.750
<i>We can become heroes, even from nothing.</i>

00:24:07.420 --> 00:24:11.920
<b>Next Episode:
That Which Ends and That Which Continues</b>
